                  "business_logic": {
                    "method": "load_warranty_history",
                    "description": "Fill the asset's name, and the Warranty History group with its earlier warranty records",
                    "spec": "When ASSET_CODE changes, read every other FAM_WARRANTY_DETAILS row for that asset (excluding the record being edited, newest end date first) and replace the rows of form 2 (Warranty History) with one read-only line per warranty: id, provider, start date, end date, status (Active / Expired / Upcoming as of today) and terms. No earlier warranties, or the code cleared, empties the group (the screen hides it). Also fills the header's ASSET_NAME from FAM_ASSET_REGISTER (blank when the code is cleared or matches no asset).",
